# Drip environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values. `.env.local` is ignored
# by git, so keys never end up in the repository. Never put keys in the code.
#
# Step 1 (the current app) needs no variables: all data stays on the device.
#
# Later roadmap steps will add these (exact names are confirmed in each step):
#
# Step 2, accounts and database (Supabase)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=
#
# Step 3, reminders (Resend email + web push)
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
#
# Step 4, payments (Stripe)
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
